      47.85,
      354.13,
      538.85,
      401.2
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by the Section 70 of the Tourism Act, No. 38 of 2005, I, John Antony EmmanualAmarathunga, Minister of Tourism Development and Christian Religious Affairs, do hereby order in line with the Section49(a) of the Land Acquisitions Act, that the land mentioned in the Schedule below is required to be acquired for thepurpose of development of tourism by Sri Lanka Tourism Development Authority.",
